{
  "name": "5 - Manager Approves or Waives Fee",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 5. Manager Approves or Waives the Fee\n\n**In simple words:** the manager taps the link from the text. A page shows who, when and how much, with two buttons: **Charge** or **Waive**.\n- **Charge:** Square charges the saved card, the client gets a receipt text.\n- **Waive:** nothing is charged.\nEither way it is written in the **Fees** tab of the Google Sheet.\n\nThe link only opens a page. Money moves only when the manager presses **Charge**.",
        "width": 640,
        "height": 340,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "cb5ab74f-2a11-48d2-8d64-b09741ec89f1",
      "name": "Note 0",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -60,
        -440
      ]
    },
